This repository contains a modified version of jieba
(https://github.com/fxsjy/jieba, Copyright (c) 2013 Sun Junyi).
The original MIT license above applies to all derived code.

Modifications (2026-10-17), described in PATCH.md:
  - jieba/__init__.py: added Tokenizer._route(), a single-pass replacement
    for the get_DAG() + calc() pair used by the accurate-mode cutters.
  - jieba/finalseg/__init__.py: rewrote viterbi() to use back-pointers
    instead of copying the full path at every step, plus an unrolled
    BMES fast path.
Modifications copyright (c) 2026 the contributors of this repository,
released under the same MIT terms.
